<!doctype html>
<html lang="es-AR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <!-- Google tag (gtag.js) - Google Ads Base -->
    <script is:inline async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=AW-642736374"></script>
    <script is:inline>
      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
      function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
      gtag('js', new Date());

      gtag('config', 'AW-642736374');
    </script>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="5;url=/sociales/" />
    <title>Gracias por tu consulta · Show Interactivo</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Montserrat:wght@700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      :root{--bg:#4c1c56;--deep:#2a0e30;--accent:#e7048f;--white:#fff;--light:rgba(255,255,255,.84);--line:rgba(255,255,255,.14)}
      *{box-sizing:border-box}
      html,body{margin:0;min-height:100%}
      body{min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%,rgba(231,4,143,.24),transparent 36%),linear-gradient(145deg,var(--bg),var(--deep));color:var(--white);font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
      main{width:min(100%,620px);text-align:center}
      .logo{display:block;width:min(230px,58vw);height:auto;margin:0 auto 28px}
      .card{padding:clamp(32px,7vw,56px);background:rgba(42,14,48,.72);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.3);backdrop-filter:blur(12px)}
      .eyebrow{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--accent);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}
      h1{margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'Montserrat',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(32px,7vw,52px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.02;text-transform:uppercase}
      p{margin:0 auto;color:var(--light);font-size:clamp(16px,3.8vw,19px);line-height:1.6}
      .redirect{margin-top:12px;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.64)}
      .button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:52px;margin-top:28px;padding:13px 28px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--white);color:var(--bg);font-family:'Montserrat',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;transition:transform .2s,background .2s,color .2s}
      .button:hover{background:var(--accent);color:var(--white);transform:translateY(-2px)}
      .button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--white);outline-offset:4px}
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <img class="logo" src="/media/images/logo.png" alt="Show Interactivo" />
      <section class="card" aria-live="polite">
        <p class="eyebrow">Consulta recibida</p>
        <h1>¡Gracias por escribirnos!</h1>
        <p>Recibimos tu consulta. En breve nos vamos a poner en contacto para ayudarte a crear una fiesta inolvidable.</p>
        <p class="redirect">Volvemos a Sociales automáticamente en 5 segundos.</p>
        <a class="button" href="/sociales/">Volver ahora</a>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
